.MARINE...
(Today through Saturday)
Issued at 930 AM PDT Mon Oct 5 2026

An extensive low stratus and fog layer is steadily advancing
eastward across the coastal waters and will reach much of the
coastline throughout the morning and into the afternoon. A gentle
to moderate breeze and slight to moderate wave heights persist
into midweek. Winds increase and wave heights build, seas becoming
rough across the outer waters, Friday into the weekend.

